qdev-host (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Proxmox VE web UI: qdev-host devices in the VM Hardware panel (Add > qdev-host
    Device, Remove), backed by qdev-host-api.service (ticket-authorised node
    service) and a guarded index.html.tpl overlay (qdev-host-ui) that coexists
    with qsm-pve-direct.
  * qdevctl: shared library operations, status with live state; plugin
    sidecar metadata (tb-vga.json).

